---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  description="Fryrvo Ai statement"
  title="Ai statement · Fryrvo"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8">
    <div class="sm:pb:20 flex flex-col gap-4 pb-16 text-center">
      <img
        class="h-[150px] w-[250px] mx-auto rounded-3xl object-contain"
        src="https://cdn.fryrvo.com/assets/fryrvo_branding/Logo_bg.png"
        alt="icon"
      />

      <h1 class="text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">AI statement</h1>
      <p class="text-base">Well here is my view on Ai</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2 class="mb-6 mt-12 text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">Art Work</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Art, Music or anything in that umbrella</p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        I do believe that all creative work we should use Our creativity not Ai
        To be an artist you need to create something whatever it is "good" or "bad" it still you telling Ai to make something is not creating and it definitely not your is not your work
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Art should be an way for us to express our self
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Even though my work is suck but ...
        I'll not using Ai anyway possible and it will stay that way as longs as I'm still alive
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Sorry I'm not an really big fan of Ai here
      </p>

      <h2 class="mb-6 mt-12 text-xl font-medium sm:text-2xl">Software</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Ai is un deniably useful in someway don't get me wrong but there are no point of you doing some task
        Well it is a point if that was your passion
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        I believe that in this if be use correctly it will be useful tools!
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        But you should be the one that creating not using for Generate entire project Ai should be only Tools
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Same here for me Ai will still be use as a useful tools and it will be that way
      </p>

      <p class="mb-4 mt-12">
        I'm a person that love new technology and I'm sure that I'm not been bias on this point
        Anyone could agree (and they should) or disagree that you do you
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Anyway thank for reading
        <br>
        <br>
        Cath, Fryrvo
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>